# Daddy Pay

Read [AGENTS.md](../../docs/AGENTS.md), [RULE.md](../../docs/RULE.md), [DESIGN.md](../../docs/DESIGN.md) for full context.

## Auth

- Session: httpOnly cookie `token`. Backend: `{API_URL}/api/v1/admin/*`.
- Middleware validates pages; `/api/*` excluded — each route checks `cookies().get('token')`.
- **Never** put full user JSON in `x-user-data` (502 from proxy header limits). Use `getData()` → `/admin/me` via cookie.
- Token refresh: forward `X-New-Token` / `X-Token-Refreshed` via `createResponseWithHeaders` / middleware.

## API routes

```typescript
const token = (await cookies()).get('token')?.value;
if (!token) return NextResponse.json({ message: 'Unauthorized' }, { status: 401 });
const response = await axios.get(`${process.env.API_URL}/api/v1/admin/...`, {
  headers: { Authorization: `Bearer ${token}` },
});
return createResponseWithHeaders(response.data, response);
// 401 → handleTokenExpiration()
```

## Code

- BFF only from browser (`/api/...`), not `API_URL` in client.
- Pages: `src/app/(appAuth)/`; reuse hooks in `src/hooks/`, components in `src/components/`.
- Minimize diff; `@/` imports; commit only when user asks.
